      "description": "<ul>\n  <li>Minimum 3 Years experience as IT QA Automation</li>\n  <li>Experienced in creating and running test based on test script</li>\n  <li>Having knowledge in query language to check data in database, postman to check data in API.</li>\n  <li>Strong debug skill to check data communication via browser's developer tools or any similar tools to find fault in quality</li>\n  <li>Know automation concept, methods and tools to optimizes QA test result </li>\n  <li>Having experience in setup and config load test or stress test case</li>\n  <li>Having a humourous and good attitude, can work in multiple project, following latest     trend in testing area</li>\n  <li>Willing to client Office</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>",
