      "description": "<p>Job Desc : </p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Plan, execute, and optimize end-to-end CRM and customer engagement initiatives. </li>\n  <li>Manage customer communication campaigns across multiple CRM channels. </li>\n  <li>Develop campaigns based on customer lifecycle, behavioral segmentation, and business objectives. </li>\n  <li>Monitor campaign performance and analyze results to identify opportunities for improvement. </li>\n  <li>Conduct testing and optimization to improve customer engagement and campaign effectiveness. </li>\n  <li>Collaborate with relevant teams to ensure smooth execution of CRM initiatives.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Requirements:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business Administration, Data Analytics, Communications, or a related field. </li>\n  <li>2–4 years of hands-on experience in CRM, Lifecycle Marketing, Direct Response Marketing, or a related field. </li>\n  <li>Strong understanding of customer lifecycle and behavioral segmentation. </li>\n  <li>Analytical mindset with the ability to interpret campaign performance and translate insights into actionable improvements. </li>\n  <li>Strong communication and collaboration skills.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>",
